{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oh Roots and Branches! Your Kingdom needs help!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Tree Kingdoms, a minimalist 4x strategy game with bite-sized matches, designed to be played in short sessions. You are the Great Tree Spirit of a cosy woodland kingdom, but winter is coming and resources are scarce. You must secure the forest from rivals before the frost sets in. Can you outwit your foes and prove yourself a strategic master?\u00a0 <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Strategic Turn-based action!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/68e53f8313dd6695bbaf69a2ebb35a9d.poster.avif?t=1755447019\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/68e53f8313dd6695bbaf69a2ebb35a9d.webm?t=1755447019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/68e53f8313dd6695bbaf69a2ebb35a9d.mp4?t=1755447019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br>Explore the map, claim territory and upgrade your cities! Build an Empire that can stand up to your rivals and see your treelings through the harsh winter. Will you fortify or will you focus on conquest?   <br><br><strong>Race against the seasons to secure your victory in this Bite Sized 4x!</strong>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/509fba2d264f7fe415ad4bd437ac2ead.poster.avif?t=1755447019\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/509fba2d264f7fe415ad4bd437ac2ead.webm?t=1755447019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/509fba2d264f7fe415ad4bd437ac2ead.mp4?t=1755447019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter freezes the map over time, pushing your strategic thinking and forcing you to adapt. Upgrading your cities and gathering new units might be your path to salvation, sometimes surviving is better than fighting. Your Treelings will rely on you to make the right choice. Do you build tall and gather resources? Or do you walk the path of the warlord? It\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Clock is ticking</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/acfaf1a6b0920ec9c44946df4ac1b813.poster.avif?t=1755447019\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/acfaf1a6b0920ec9c44946df4ac1b813.webm?t=1755447019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/extras/acfaf1a6b0920ec9c44946df4ac1b813.mp4?t=1755447019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a limited amount of time to grow strong enough to survive winter. Stockpile resources &amp; secure safer land in the forest interior where the bite of frost is not so strong. But other Kingdoms and their Tree Spirits won\u2019t sit idly by. The clock is ticking\u2026 As time goes on ice will spread in from the cold exterior and make life much more difficult for your Kingdom so there\u2019s no time to waste!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features <br>=====================================</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic map changes with weather-based conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialise your civilisation with unique upgrades and units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A three-way battle for survival where enemies fight just as much as you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by conquest, peace or just surviving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all new factions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With infinite replayability you have the power to try out new strategies and new plans, the path to victory isn\u2019t always a straight line. Battling two other teams offers great strategic depth and new surprises each match. A smart leader might even pit enemies against each other whilst they developed in secret\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no two winters alike, will your Kingdom feast or face famine? It\u2019s in your hands now Great Tree Spirit, lead on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    <br>=====================================</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477080?t=1755447019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477080?t=1755447019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/d5f249e45494036c8daddd1a9232504a6a52825b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755447019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/d5f249e45494036c8daddd1a9232504a6a52825b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755447019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"d