 time to waste!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features <br>=====================================</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic map changes with weather-based conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialise your civilisation with unique upgrades and units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A three-way battle for survival where enemies fight just as much as you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win by conquest, peace or just surviving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all new factions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With infinite replayability you have the power to try out new strategies and new plans, the path to victory isn\u2019t always a straight line. Battling two other teams offers great strategic depth and new surprises each match. A smart leader might even pit enemies against each other whilst they developed in secret\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no two winters alike, will your Kingdom feast or face famine? It\u2019s in your hands now Great Tree Spirit, lead on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    <br>=====================================</h2>","developers":["Biscuit Factory Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/c20a8dc8f4a8f12e96e9c706839272de945b4123/header.jpg?t=1755447019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8+ GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Currently requires the Proton 9 compatibility tool.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true