th_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/d4b3632cfb91d8ea1da93bd3bb9c0d18e599e0c9/ss_d4b3632cfb91d8ea1da93bd3bb9c0d18e599e0c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755447019","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477080/d4b3632cfb91d8ea1da93bd3bb9c0d18e599e0c9/ss_d4b3632cfb91d8ea1da93bd3bb9c0d18e599e0c9.600x338.jpg?t=1755447019"}],"short_description":"Race against the oncoming Winter in this minimalist 4x Strategy Game. Rival Tree Kingdoms attack your borders... Will you conquer, outlast, or outwit them in this bite-sized turn-based battle? Command your Treelings, adapt to the seasons, and etch your legend into the bark of history!","steam_appid":3477080,"support_info":{"email":"community@biscuitfactorygames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.biscuitfactorygames.com"}